{"unit_id":"Seryta__dsh-node-nav#card-zh","repo":"Seryta/dsh-node-nav","commit":"1c2f2dd7987a0bb719cd6c01d4d78ccbd169dfb0","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-node-nav 是面向 DSH Web 的对话节点导航插件，在聊天界面右侧注册导航栏，并从当前会话记录整理真实用户消息。用户可以查看最多 15 个可见节点、悬停或键盘聚焦预览消息、点击跳转到已加载消息，或按需加载较早消息后定位；也能一键滚到最新内容。插件还提供输入历史，使用上下键在空输入框中回看先前输入，并会在用户编辑后重置位置。它适合需要快速浏览长对话、定位旧消息或重用近期输入的 DSH Web 用户。运行依赖 DSH 会话服务和客户端界面契约。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:45-67","client.js:392-445","client.js:486-605"]}
{"unit_id":"Seryta__dsh-node-nav#card-en","repo":"Seryta/dsh-node-nav","commit":"1c2f2dd7987a0bb719cd6c01d4d78ccbd169dfb0","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-node-nav adds a navigation rail to DSH Web chats. It previews and jumps to user messages, loads older messages on demand, and scrolls to the latest message. Users can recall prior composer input with arrow keys. It relies on DSH session and interface APIs.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:45-67","client.js:392-445","client.js:486-605"]}
